#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0393 expect=noViolation domain=BW
#note "BWCUSTOM is not in the model list. The order is judged only over the variables the model list knows (owner, 2026-10-02), so it is ignored here; whether it is allowed at all is CG0013 / SD0058's business. Before the change the first unknown variable ended the ordered-subset walk and the rule fired for an order that is correct."
#library standard=sendig-dart version=1-2
#library model-column-order BW STUDYID DOMAIN USUBJID BWSEQ BWGRPID BWTESTCD BWTEST BWCAT BWPOS BWORRES BWORRESU
dataset BW class=FINDINGS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col BWSEQ    type=Num
col BWTESTCD type=Char
col BWCUSTOM type=Char
col BWTEST   type=Char
col BWORRES  type=Char
---
S1 | BW | 001 | 1 | X1 | X | Test | 1
---
